{"3462960": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Malón", "steam_appid": 3462960, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462960/extras/c0c5416ae62dabc288e5d017646cd4af.avif?t=1779494190\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462960/extras_big/c0c5416ae62dabc288e5d017646cd4af.avif?t=1779494190 width=800 height=192 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Malón</strong> is an indie <strong>tower defense</strong> game with a <strong>top-down view</strong> that combines elements of <strong>strategy and skill</strong>: victory depends as much on your strategic insight as on your dexterity in controlling your character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">In <strong>Malón</strong>, you’ll manage a frontier army outpost, taking on the responsibility of defending it at all costs. To succeed, you’ll need to grow your economy, expand your base, and train soldiers to fight by your side in defense of the flag.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462960/extras/2c00291126cc11156e0cf4f3937e45f2.webp?t=1779494190\" width=800 height=45 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>Day and Night Cycles:</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">During the day — when strategy takes center stage — you’ll have to think carefully about how to invest your coins, because once night falls, there’s no turning back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462960/extras/77cf5b3eb480aaa6f9a8eafdbe19dcd7.poster.avif?t=1779494190\" width=622 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462960/extras/77cf5b3eb480aaa6f9a8eafdbe19dcd7.webm?t=1779494190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462960/extras/77cf5b3eb480aaa6f9a8eafdbe19dcd7.mp4?t=1779494190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">During the dark hours, you'll have to fight with whatever you've got. The worse your decisions were during the day, the more you’ll need to make up for them with your skill at night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462960/extras/061e1dfc4fdc2cc77540be06afb6e55a.poster.avif?t=1779494190\" width=622 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462960/extras/061e1dfc4fdc2cc77540be06afb6e55a.webm?t=1779494190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462960/extras/061e1dfc4fdc2cc77540be06afb6e55a.mp4?t=1779494190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462960/extras/2c00291126cc11156e0cf4f3937e45f2.webp?t=1779494190\" width=800 height=45 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>Upgrade Units and Structures:</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Expanding the fort with new structures and units isn’t enough, you’ll also have to upgrade them before it’s too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462960/extras/fd5320e9472c5cca9ecf8e8955d4beab.avif?t=1779494190\" width=552 height=397 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Give your gauchos boleadoras, replace your soldiers’ old muskets with breech-loading rifles, load your cannons with grapeshot… These are just some of the things awaiting you in Malón.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462960/extras/2c00291126cc11156e0cf4f3937e45f2.webp?t=1779494190\" width=800 height=45 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>Malon's Campaign:</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462960/extras/adc4914df825702680a8e59d468fa25e.avif?t=1779494190\" width=900 height=266 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Each of these has its own characteristics that make it unique. Discover what lies hidden in Pampa, Patagonia, and Andes to earn three stars on every level!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462960/extras/2c00291126cc11156e0cf4f3937e45f2.webp?t=1779494190\" width=800 height=45 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>Endless Survival Mode:</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462960/extras/669dcc02e35a37a97b8fccb3f89185a2.avif?t=1779494190\" width=205 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Compare your skills with other players! Survival mode features a global ranking, where you’ll be able to fight for a spot in the top 10 players who have managed to withstand the most nights with their fort.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462960/extras/2c00291126cc11156e0cf4f3937e45f2.webp?t=1779494190\" width=800 height=45 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462960/extras/c0c5416ae62dabc288e5d017646cd4af.avif?t=1779494190\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462960/extras_big/c0c5416ae62dabc288e5d017646cd4af.avif?t=1779494190 width=800 height=192 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Malón</strong> is an indie <strong>tower defense</strong> game with a <strong>top-down view</strong> that combines elements of <strong>strategy and skill</strong>: victory depends as much on your strategic insight as on your dexterity in controlling your character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style